### Build artefacts ###
build/
*.o
*.obj
.DS_Store

### The dependency's tree ###
# `deps/teko` is a checkout of teko-lang at the tag `mc.lock` pins, put there
# by README.md's one command and by CI; it is never committed here.
deps/

### The mc toolchain a CI job unpacks ###
.mc-toolchain/

### Host configs derived from `teko.toml` ###
# `mc.macos.toml` and `mc.<fixture>.toml` are born from a `sed` over the
# versioned `teko.toml` and are transient to one host or one loop. The two
# versioned files are `teko.toml` and `mc.toml`, and `mc.lock` beside them.
/mc.*.toml
!/mc.toml
